# the cases this column serves: a case name or glob per line, then the reason.
# aarch64-linux with FEAT_FP16 selected changes codegen only by computing f16
# on the h registers and f16 lanes on the .8h arrangement, so the column serves
# the f16 cases and nothing else: every other case would repeat aarch64-linux.

float/f16_*     the FEAT_FP16 arithmetic, comparisons and integer conversions (#3801).
vec/rows_f16    the FEAT_FP16 lane arithmetic and comparisons (#3802).
vec/cast_lanes  the f16 lane conversions through the FEAT_FP16 integer rows (#3802).
